{"about":["Famous cola and mint candy mix effect in the fast-paced runner game. Collect as many cola bottles as you can and blow them up with the mints. The more bottles you collect, the longer your jump will be. You don't have to follow the road if you don't want to - just use the jumps to change the lines and overtake your opponents in the race!","Uses DUALSHOCK 4 vibration function","Offline single player","Offline play enabled","Enhanced game play on PS4 Pro console","Remote Play allows users to connect to and play games on their PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5 using a mobile device, PC, or another PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5.","One-time licence fee to download to multiple PS4 systems. Sign in to PlayStation is not required to use this on your primary PS4, but is required for use on other PS4 systems.","See Health Warnings for important health information before using this product."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0312/283c8e8f8b406d5f20412211f123d7cc0c972e52d1ec1e0a.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0312/283c8e8f8b406d5f20412211f123d7cc0c972e52d1ec1e0a.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0312/896ad4b049bdd65ef5acb85a745ca28e745cd415298989a6.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0312/896ad4b049bdd65ef5acb85a745ca28e745cd415298989a6.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0312/0865c40a033c835765bdc6c86e00e848f4c50734ead12a10.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0312/0865c40a033c835765bdc6c86e00e848f4c50734ead12a10.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0312/05c515583a644d8bdf05b8d5e790b98b9f83e831e788868e.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202407/0312/05c515583a644d8bdf05b8d5e790b